-| `uv run python tools/performance/measure_python.py` | each function's prepared path, held once, on `Cells` built before the clock | validation, the probe, result conversion; `cells_from_buffers` from buffers as its own scenario | the host, Excel, building the inputs |
+| `uv run python tools/performance/measure_python.py` | each function's prepared path, held once, on `Cells` built before the clock | validation, the probe, result conversion; `cells_from_buffers` from buffers as its own scenario; a creator's publication and its release, so the store does not grow | the host, Excel, building the inputs |
